    <briefdescription>
<para>Opens a <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1FileScanTask" kindref="compound">FileScanTask</ref> as an <ref refid="structArrowArrayStream" kindref="compound">ArrowArrayStream</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classiceberg_1_1FileScanTaskReader" kindref="compound">FileScanTaskReader</ref> chooses the copy-on-write path for tasks without deletes and the merge-on-read path for tasks with v2 position or equality deletes. The returned stream exposes the fields of <computeroutput>projected_schema</computeroutput> with list widths determined by <computeroutput>read.arrow.use-large-list</computeroutput>, or fails if the reader cannot honor that setting. When <computeroutput>apply_residuals</computeroutput> is enabled, each task&apos;s residual filter is enforced after deletes and before final projection.</para>
<para>TODO(gangwu): Add a mode that emits a <computeroutput>_deleted</computeroutput> column instead of filtering rows. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
